 ("Can I use WeChat in Pakistan to contact Chinese suppliers?", "Yes. You can sign up with a Pakistani number, though some new accounts need an existing WeChat user to scan a QR code to confirm you. Use it for talking, not for paying."),
 ("Is it better to contact suppliers on Alibaba or WeChat?", "Start on Alibaba. The conversation stays on record and the order can be paid through Alibaba with Trade Assurance. Move to WeChat only for quick questions with a seller you have checked."),
 ("Do Chinese suppliers speak English?", "Most Alibaba sales staff write in English, often with machine translation. 1688 and Taobao sellers usually reply in Chinese. Short, simple sentences work best."),
